96,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-e-o052b-q","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-9069564ba3deaa3c0f41","layer":"original","quote":"琮子寄，果阿附鲁王，轻为交构〖18〗。逊书与琮曰：“卿不师日!〖19〗，而宿留阿寄〖20〗，终为足下门户致祸矣。”琮既不纳，更以致隙〖21〗。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":246,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":93,"end":164,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-q-o052","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-9069564ba3deaa3c0f41","layer":"original","quote":"先是，二宫并阙〖15〗；中外职司〖16〗，多遣子弟给侍。全琮报逊，逊以为：“子弟苟有才，不忧不用，不宜私出以要荣利〖17〗；若其不佳，终为取祸。且闻二宫势敌，必有彼此，此古人之厚忌也。”琮子寄，果阿附鲁王，轻为交构〖18〗。逊书与琮曰：“卿不师日!〖19〗，而宿留阿寄〖20〗，终为足下门户致祸矣。”琮既不纳，更以致隙〖21〗。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":246,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":164,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"panlu-q-90c1a58221a216cbb567","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-b41003707cccf82182ea","layer":"original","quote":"会全寄，杨竺等阿附鲁王霸，与和分争，阴相谮构","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":240,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":32,"end":54,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"panlu-q-df7c5a57940e2ab79a0a","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-2f8f206f4f039d83c0a9","layer":"pei","quote":"竺不胜痛毒，服是所道。初权疑竺泄之，及服，以为果然：乃斩竺","attribution":"裴注·《吴录》","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":267,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-90be1bc5b1a157bbf567","start":200,"end":229,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-44736858bd150782c131","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-4b82ceb061997a002877","layer":"original","quote":"流竺尸于江；兄穆，以数谏戒竺，得免大辟，犹徙南州〖15〗。霸赐死后，又诛寄、安、奇等：咸以党霸构和故也","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":227,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":39,"end":90,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-60e5b248903bb26daf08","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-f77eaac96e37b2d3db4c","layer":"original","quote":"陆逊、吾粲、顾谭等数陈嫡庶之义，理不可夺；全寄、杨竺为鲁王霸支党，谮诉日兴〖6〗。粲遂下狱诛，谭徙交州","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":160,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-e1d8884fd529e9e75a5e","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-4b82ceb061997a002877","layer":"original","quote":"时全寄、吴安、孙奇、杨竺等，阴共附霸，图危太子。谮毁既行，太子以败，霸亦赐死","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":227,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-f5c695232dc8ff7315a1","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-f77eaac96e37b2d3db4c","layer":"original","quote":"陆逊、吾粲、顾谭等数陈嫡庶之义，理不可夺；全寄、杨竺为鲁王霸支党，谮诉日兴〖6〗。粲遂下狱诛，谭徙交州","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":160,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-2113b80d6f9f8a3da0c7","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-027aa53bd5dbba95ebf6","layer":"original","quote":"时长公主婿卫将军全琮子寄，为霸宾客〖19〗；寄素倾邪〖20〗，谭所不纳。先是，谭弟承与张休俱北征寿春，全琮时为大都督；与魏将王凌战于芍陂，军不利，魏兵乘胜陷没五营将秦（儿）〔晃〕军；休、承奋击之，遂驻魏师〖21〗。时琮群子绪、端，亦并为将，因敌既驻，乃进击之：凌军用退","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":197,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":134,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-fc9f571d0cb76f69f3a1","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-027aa53bd5dbba95ebf6","layer":"original","quote":"寄父子益恨，共构会谭","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":197,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":181,"end":191,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
